<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>爆料公社最新動態</title><link>https://web.bc3ts.net</link><atom:link href="http://rsshub.isrss.com/bc3ts/post/list" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><description>爆料公社最新動態 - Powered by RSSHub</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>contact@rsshub.app (RSSHub)</webMaster><language>zh-TW</language><image><url>https://img.bc3ts.net/image/web/main/logo-white-new-2023.png</url><title>爆料公社最新動態</title><link>https://web.bc3ts.net</link></image><lastBuildDate>Wed, 01 Oct 2025 00:18:52 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>5</ttl><item><title>早安愉快❤️</title><description>早安愉快❤️&lt;br&gt;   &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.bc3ts.net/image/post/tumb/1759276422686_f659e257-0fa3-4f0b-ab01-207be8f44bd9.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;1759276422686_f659e257-0fa3-4f0b-ab01-207be8f44bd9.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6850125</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6850125</guid><pubDate>Tue, 30 Sep 2025 23:53:43 GMT</pubDate><author>賈angel</author><category>爆廢公社</category></item><item><title>懂的變通</title><description>懂的變通&lt;br&gt;   &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.bc3ts.net/image/post/tumb/1759276309773_2dc91937-122f-4e8c-8480-ae66bafcfcd5.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;1759276309773_2dc91937-122f-4e8c-8480-ae66bafcfcd5.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6850123</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6850123</guid><pubDate>Tue, 30 Sep 2025 23:51:51 GMT</pubDate><author>流雲</author><category>爆廢公社</category></item><item><title>可樂滷花枝</title><description>可樂滷花枝&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;【材　料】&lt;br&gt;A.花枝700公克&lt;br&gt;薑片10公克&lt;br&gt;可樂150cc&lt;br&gt;蒜苗片適量&lt;br&gt;水1200cc&lt;br&gt;B.八角1粒&lt;br&gt;桂皮5公克&lt;br&gt;草果1粒&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;【調 味 料】&lt;br&gt;米酒1大匙&lt;br&gt;醬油80cc&lt;br&gt;鹽1/2大匙&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;【做　法】&lt;br&gt;1.將所有材料B裝入棉質滷包袋中捆緊，即為可樂滷包。&lt;br&gt;2.花枝洗淨，放入電鍋內鍋中，加入薑片、作法1的滷包、水、所有調味料，再倒入可樂，外鍋加1杯水，煮至開關跳起燜5分鐘。&lt;br&gt;3.食用時取出滷好花枝切片擺盤，再放入蒜苗片即可。&lt;br&gt;   &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.bc3ts.net/image/post/tumb/1759276235008_8917ed02-24c1-465b-b7ba-7c57c3ebade5.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;1759276235008_8917ed02-24c1-465b-b7ba-7c57c3ebade5.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6850122</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6850122</guid><pubDate>Tue, 30 Sep 2025 23:50:37 GMT</pubDate><author>蠻霸</author><category>廚藝公社</category></item><item><title>歡樂十月大家好</title><description>歡樂十月大家好&lt;br&gt;   &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.bc3ts.net/image/post/tumb/1759276036617_373cf699-dda5-4e1e-94e0-da2e69fd500c.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;1759276036617_373cf699-dda5-4e1e-94e0-da2e69fd500c.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6850119</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6850119</guid><pubDate>Tue, 30 Sep 2025 23:47:17 GMT</pubDate><author>匿名</author><category>爆廢公社</category></item><item><title>早</title><description>#植物&lt;br&gt;   &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.bc3ts.net/image/post/tumb/1759275971483_799b28c1-13ef-4b1d-9390-ed9bebb81451.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;1759275971483_799b28c1-13ef-4b1d-9390-ed9bebb81451.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6850117</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6850117</guid><pubDate>Tue, 30 Sep 2025 23:46:16 GMT</pubDate><author>飛翔</author><category>花草本一家</category></item><item><title>是我要求太多嗎？</title><description>是我要求太多嗎？&lt;br&gt;婆家共4間廁所，&lt;br&gt;我們ㄧ家四口被安排和其中一個家人共用一間衛浴，公婆用一間，有一位家人自己用一間，剩一間是一樓的公用廁所，我ㄧ直搞不懂為什麼我們ㄧ家四口了，還要再擠另一個人進來，使用上不舒服之外，有外人使用的廁所我真的無法忍髒打掃&lt;br&gt;每次想到這個就覺得是不是乾脆不要那麼常回去，別人偏心的安排為什麼要我受罪&lt;br&gt;又要我們回去，又不安排好，好的都讓其他人先選，剩的才輪到我們，到底是什麼邏輯？！0</description><link>https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6850115</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://w